                                                "example_id": "c16f4945-0492-448d-bbdf-161436eeeb8f",
                                                "sense_id": "c13e2734-ddfe-3bf2-a522-114240cca61c",
                                                "text": "Though the tephrosia is a powerful agent, and, if carried too far beyond the antagonistic action of the poison, is, I presume, not entirely without danger, I have never known any bad symptoms to arise from its use."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "52440d41-1df2-44a3-8b44-29ce724c59f2",
                                                "sense_id": "c13e2734-ddfe-3bf2-a522-114240cca61c",
                                                "text": "And deputies from opposing parties, inherently more antagonistic than deputies from the same party, can be bought at a lower price."
                                            },
